- Ya.

00:05:42.134 --> 00:05:43.218
Tidak.

00:05:46.138 --> 00:05:46.972
Tak apa-apa.

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:50.601
Tapi, kenapa?

00:05:52.478 --> 00:05:53.812
Karena aku punya seseorang,

00:05:53.937 --> 00:05:55.064
