Rob?

00:08:44.316 --> 00:08:45.150
Kau masih di sini?

00:08:49.071 --> 00:08:50.113
Ya.

00:08:51.281 --> 00:08:52.491
Di sini, John.

00:08:55.953 --> 00:08:56.912
Itu menyenangkan.

00:08:57.579 --> 00:08:58.747
Ya.

