00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:52.786
Hanya...

00:15:53.745 --> 00:15:54.913
Tak ada alasan.

00:15:55.497 --> 00:15:59.626
Apa karena aku terlihat
seperti tinggal di hutan ajaib

00:16:00.377 --> 00:16:05.382
